scene downtown
  [[show backdrop ext_downtown_main_street with fade over 1]]
  $: EXT. DOWNTOWN - MAIN STREET - DAY

  Saturday crowds drift past the shops. The diner's neon sign is switched off.

  MARCUS:
    [[marcus:happy]]
    The diner doesn't open till five. We need someone who was here last night.

  choose
    Where should the friends start?
    * [Follow Theo to the fountain.]
      -> fountain
    * [Follow Zadie to the alley behind the diner.]
      -> alley
  end

  branch fountain
    [[show backdrop ext_downtown_fountain with fade over 1]]
    $: EXT. DOWNTOWN - PARK - DAY

    A busker packs up a battered guitar beside the fountain.

    THEO:
      [[theo:happy]]
      Everybody ends up at the fountain eventually.

    The busker hums a few bars, then stops.

    THEO:
      [[theo:sad]]
      Wait. What's that song called?

    Theo writes it down\: *Moonlight on the Rails*.
    & heard_song_title = true
    & clues_found += 1
    -> compare_notes
  end

  branch alley
    [[show backdrop ext_downtown_alley with fade over 1]]
    $: EXT. DOWNTOWN - ALLEY - DAY

    // This sound has not been recorded yet, so the editor warns about it.
    ((sfx_jukebox_coin_clink))
    Something small and silver rolls out from under the diner's back door.

    ZADIE:
      [[zadie:happy]]
      A quarter from 1962. Nobody carries these anymore.

    & found_coin = true
    & clues_found += 1
    -> compare_notes
  end

  branch compare_notes
    [[show backdrop ext_downtown_park_cafe with fade over 1]]
    $: EXT. DOWNTOWN - PARK CAFE - AFTERNOON

    IMANI:
      [[imani:happy]]
      Clues so far\: {clues_found}. Not bad for one afternoon.

    MARCUS:
      [[marcus:angry]]
      One clue is not a pattern.

    ZADIE:
      [[zadie:angry]]
      Then we go to the diner tonight and watch it happen.

    -> load the_diner
  end
end
